</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaneko</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukumoto</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukatsu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hirano</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukuyama</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakayama</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Fujita</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Yoshida</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Enhanced expression of interleukin-6 in primary human renal call carcinoma</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>1991</year><volume>83</volume><fpage>1668</fpage><lpage>1672</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Natl Cancer Inst||83|1668||bib22|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1749019</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tsukamoto</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kumamoto</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Miyao</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Masumori</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Takahashi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Yanase</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Interleukin-6 in renal cell carcinoma</article-title><source>J Urol</source><year>1992</year><volume>148</volume><fpage>1778</fpage><lpage>1782</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Urol||148|1778||bib23|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1433606</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Waase</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergholz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Iglauer</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Beissert</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Blech</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Schauer</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kronke</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Heterogeneity of tumor necrosis factor production in renal cell carcinoma</article-title><source>Eur J Cancer</source><year>1992</year><volume>28A</volume><fpage>1660</fpage><lpage>1664</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Eur J Cancer||28A|1660||bib24|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1389482</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>